Fix: add `CCR_ROUTINE_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.CCR_ROUTINE_TOKEN }}` beneath the marker — the line the wiring converge would write if it could push to `.github/workflows/`, which it cannot, so this takes a human-merged PR.
